1
00:00:00,761 --> 00:00:04,291
(Bernadette:)I don't know why he was upset.
They were bigger on him than me.

2
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:08,597
I'm really curious what's in that letter.

3
00:00:08,769 --> 00:00:10,899
(Bernadette:)Me too, but I guess now we'll never know.

4
00:00:11,071 --> 00:00:13,371
(Amy:)You said Sheldon read it.
Why not ask him?

5
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:17,601
(Bernadette:)I can't do that. What kind of wife would I be
if I didn't respect my husband's privacy?

6
00:00:17,978 --> 00:00:20,138
(Penny:)What if I ask
and you happen to be in the room?

7
00:00:20,314 --> 00:00:21,944
- That works.
- Okay.

8
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,400
Blech!

9
00:00:46,707 --> 00:00:50,477
It's like cleaning out
the entire building's belly button.

10
00:00:52,112 --> 00:00:54,442
- Hey, Sheldon.
- Oh, hello.

11
00:00:54,615 --> 00:00:56,015
(Sheldon:)What can I do for you ladies?

12
00:00:56,484 --> 00:01:00,084
- You have something we want.
- Oh, dear.

